  "bio": "Sgrounch, owner of the renowned Tiger Rider Tattoo studio in Lecce, Italy, showcases a profound expertise in creating traditional and Japanese style tattoos. Despite being known for his unapologetically brutal personality, his high level of professionalism and adherence to strict cleanliness standards is widely respected and unquestionable.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Lecce, Apulia, Italy"
